This is not an open-source licence. It covers the images in images/ and the texts in README.md, index.html and
facts.json ("the press kit"). COLONIZED and the names of its ships, factions and places are the property of their
creator; this licence grants no trademark rights.

1. Editorial use is permitted, free of charge and without asking first: news, previews, reviews, articles, interviews,
   videos, streams, podcasts and academic or reference works about COLONIZED, in any medium.

2. Credit "COLONIZED" next to the image or in the credits (for example, "Render: COLONIZED") and, where the medium
   allows it, link to https://colonized.work/.

3. You may resize, crop and compress the images, and quote the texts and facts. Do not otherwise alter the images, add
   other material to them, or present them as in-game captures: they are renders of the ship models.

4. Not permitted without written permission: advertising or promotion of any other product or service; merchandise or
   anything sold on its own; using the material to suggest that COLONIZED endorses you, your publication or anyone
   else; and any use that misrepresents the state of the game.

5. The facts change as the game is developed. The current version is always https://colonized.work/facts/. Please
   link to it when you quote them.

6. The press kit is provided as is. Permission can be withdrawn for future uses if these terms are not respected.

Contact: admin@colonized.work

